# Phase 007 — entry handoff

Status: **PLANNED — nine-group design accepted; OPS-### namespace accepted; no OPS contracts accepted yet; Group 01 next.**

Preserve:

- Lineage relationship ≠ metric/status propagation ≠ causality;
- prospective blast radius/reachability ≠ actual exposure/Impact;
- Change Intent ≠ Deployment ≠ realized Change;
- intended dependency/schedule ≠ actual execution sequence;
- first-deviation localization ≠ root cause;
- reconciliation/localization remains Investigation evidence below Causal Claim;
- candidate/reachable ≠ exposed ≠ downstream effect ≠ consequence ≠ causal attribution;
- safeguard activation ≠ prevented exposure ≠ healthy/fresh downstream output;
- health Assessment ≠ result suitability ≠ readiness ≠ gate decision ≠ enforcement ≠ execution;
- gate hold/admit/override ≠ enforcement/execution outcome;
- passive monitoring remains non-blocking for ungated production;
- historical topology/change/control reasoning uses event/effective time plus knowledge cut and does not project current state backward;
- HLTH-001–HLTH-066 metric/schema/Baseline/threshold/reconciliation/composite/freshness semantics are consumed, not redefined by operational convenience.

Accepted Phase 007 group order:

1. Lineage Relationship Taxonomy, Historical Topology & Operational Relevance.
2. Change Intent, Deployment Realization & Realized Change.
3. Prospective Blast Radius & Change-Aware Review.
4. Execution Reconstruction, Dependency Sequence & Version Use.
5. Investigation Lifecycle, First-Deviation Localization & Causal Handoff.
6. Impact, Consumer Encounter, Exposure & Consequence.
7. Propagation Safeguard Scope, Enforcement, Release & Recovery.
8. Execution Gate, Fallback/Override & Control-Induced Operational Effects.
9. Historical Operational Replay & Consolidation / Exit Review.

`OPS-###` begins at OPS-001 only when Group 01 starts. OPS identifiers are refinement contracts, not a new Operations truth owner.

Do not choose graph storage, event store, scheduler/orchestrator, safeguard/quarantine mechanism, gate implementation, streaming/cache topology, source integration, RCA algorithm, concrete timeout/latency SLA or other technical architecture in Phase 007 merely to refine functional semantics.

Do not begin Group 01 without explicit user direction.
